, and reporting into a practitioner-quality deliverable.", "children": [{"id": "0dfcec3a-4b62-4838-887a-a8d7c41b159e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Case setup", "children": [{"id": "5f94e753-feca-496a-a038-3c50b1abe2bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Client background and risk memo"}, {"id": "b77902be-a7fa-48cf-a48a-c40a1bd145b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Materiality and planning analytics"}, {"id": "76423894-578a-4e09-8e3a-d944721266d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Control walkthroughs and audit plan"}], "description": "Students apply the full audit process to a realistic client or public-company case."}, {"id": "23385514-5ed0-43e1-b7e9-af7223f74827", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Workpaper package", "children": [{"id": "d4725031-1f62-4e0d-b99c-a6a44ee82b32", "type": "concept", "title": "Control testing workpapers"}, {"id": "62cf1153-fec6-4fea-b385-c665c5c7008f", "type": "concept", "title": "Substantive testing and analytics"}, {"id": "a2b88ba2-a6d3-48f5-9bee-9baf3a251198", "type": "concept", "title": "Exception resolution and conclusion memos"}], "description": "The capstone requires evidence, not just a narrative."}, {"id": "8c6e22a6-3315-4b1c-8561-e5a93fdbaad0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional communication", "children": [{"id": "5a9ac8a5-63de-4c57-ac5f-97e4adf0874c", "type": "concept", "title": "Audit committee communication"}, {"id": "5fcfcfd5-eb0d-4d48-823c-261af361babe", "type": "concept", "title": "Management letter points"}, {"id": "ea4a5b7a-3ac5-40cb-ae8f-0025360bbf1e", "type": "concept", "title": "Final report recommendation and reflection"}], "description": "Audit findings must be precise, tactful, and defensible."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$audjson$::jsonb,
